; The QSound board's Z80 for the prototype: interrupts off, then halt for
; good. One-byte opcodes only: the board decrypts opcodes and operands
; with different Kabuki tables (kabuki.ts in frontend/packages/cps1 encodes these).
	org 0
	di
	halt
